        "bodyHtml": "Galio fires two windblasts that deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/105/140/175/210 + (70% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> each. When the windblasts meet, they combine into a tornado that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(8 + (4% Ability Power))max Health magic damage</span> over 2 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Percent Health damage deals a max of <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">200 damage</span> to jungle monsters.</span>",
