      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "GalioW",
        "name": "Shield of Durand",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Galio charges a defensive stance, moving slowly. Upon releasing the charge, Galio will taunt and damage nearby enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Galio gains a <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(7.5/9/10.5/12/13.5% Health) Magic Shield</span> after not taking damage for (12 ~ 8) seconds.<br /><br /><span>Begin Charging:</span> Galio reduces incoming magic damage by (25/30/35/40/45% + (0.04% Ability Power) + (0.08% bonus Magic Resist) + (0.01% bonus Health)) and incoming physical damage by (12.5/15/17.5/20/22.5% + (0.02% Ability Power) + (0.04% bonus Magic Resist) + (0.005% bonus Health)) and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> himself by 15%.<br /><br /><span>Release:</span> Galio <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Taunts</span> enemy champions for between 0.5 to 1.5 seconds, deals between <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(20/30/40/50/60 + (30% Ability Power))</span> and <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/90/120/150/180 + (90% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, and refreshes the damage reduction for 2 seconds. Taunt duration, damage, and range increase with charge time.",
